    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The echo of iron resounds\u2014seize the future within it.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Metal: Academy Defense Line</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate future, a survival FPS unfolds within the ruins of a Japanese school.<br>Players take on the role of the calm and composed protagonist, <strong>Suzune Amagi</strong>, as she confronts an invasion of drone robots.<br>Set in meticulously recreated classrooms and gymnasiums, intense battles await\u2014driven by sharp strategy and highly advanced drone AI.<br>As the clang of metal reverberates through the air, can you defend the academy\u2014and the future?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The echo of iron resounds\u2014seize the future within it.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Metal: Academy Defense Line</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate future, a survival FPS unfolds within the ruins of a Japanese school.<br>Players take on the role of the calm and composed protagonist, <strong>Suzune Amagi</strong>, as she confronts an invasion of drone robots.<br>Set in meticulously recreated classrooms and gymnasiums, intense battles await\u2014driven by sharp strategy and highly advanced drone AI.<br>As the clang of metal reverberates through the air, can you defend the academy\u2014and the future?</p>",
